From cd85c664551bf3f62c39ce9765654c205429e84b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fuzailmansuri <mfm9875@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:15:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Implement DynamicBar status pill and island
 services

Port Evolution-X / crDroid 17.0 DynamicBar (axdynamicbar) into SystemUI
with native Android 17 Compose architecture and trunk-stable compatibility.

- Implement AxDynamicBarController and StatusBarRoot wiring.
- Support real-time media now-playing, charging, calls, and ongoing alerts.
- Integrate Material 3 Expressive tokens and Monet dynamic theming.
- Add AxBlurSurface for hardware-accelerated frosted glass effects.
- Suppress blur regions when notification stack is occluded to prevent
  SurfaceFlinger dual-Kawase blur frame drops during shade expansion.
- Preserve native Heads-Up Notification (HUN) presentation to maintain
  full messaging and bubble interaction integrity.

Change-Id: I8262860b6fc7b4cdc417c8dccf655b4859601396
